# ============================================================================
# ZENITH ORBITRON  —  INTEGRATION LAYER  (v7.0)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The GUI code below is the original ground station, unchanged apart from the
# marked blocks.  All communication logic now lives in the ``zenith`` package:
#
#   zenith.config     - channel table, field mapping, constants
#   zenith.protocol   - wire protocol (15-field '@' frame, receiver report,
#                       'RX,' echo, legacy 'CAN,' frame) and validation
#   zenith.receiver   - streaming decoder used by the serial worker
#   zenith.serial_link- QThread owning the port (no widget is touched there)
#   zenith.telemetry  - TelemetryStore: THE single shared data source
#   zenith.attitude   - attitude derived from the received accelerometer/gyro
#   zenith.transmitter- Python mirror of the TX frame builder (tests / HIL only)
#
# The module search path is extended first so the package is found no matter
# which directory the application is started from.
# ============================================================================
